#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:322
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "It is possible to write a script to perform regular snapshots on user "
#| "data. However, over time, snapshots can consume a great deal of disk "
