#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:447
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data Verification"
msgstr "数据校验"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:451
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ZFS uses checksums to verify the integrity of stored data.  Creating file "
"systems automatically enables them."
msgstr "ZFS 使用校验和验证存储数据的完整性。创建文件系统时会自动启用校验和。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:458
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Disabling Checksums is possible but _not_ recommended! Checksums take little "
"storage space and provide data integrity.  Most ZFS features will not work "
"properly with checksums disabled.  Disabling these checksums will not "
"increase performance noticeably."
msgstr "可以禁用校验和，但__不__建议这样做！校验和占用的存储空间很少，却能确保数据完整性。禁用校验和后，大多数 ZFS 功能都无法正常工作。禁用校验和并不会显著提升性能。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:461
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Verifying the data checksums (called _scrubbing_) ensures integrity of the "
"`storage` pool with:"
msgstr "验证数据校验和（称为__清理__）可确保 `storage` 池的完整性："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:465
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# zpool scrub storage\n"
msgstr "# zpool scrub storage\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:471
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The duration of a scrub depends on the amount of data stored.  Larger "
"amounts of data will take proportionally longer to verify.  Since scrubbing "
"is I/O intensive, ZFS allows a single scrub to run on each pool at a time.  "
"After scrubbing completes, view the status with `zpool status`:"
msgstr "清理所需时间取决于存储的数据量。数据量越大，验证所需时间也会相应增加。由于清理会大量使用 I/O，ZFS 允许每个池一次只运行一个清理任务。清理完成后，使用 `zpool status` 查看状态："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:479
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zpool status storage\n"
"  pool: storage\n"
" state: ONLINE\n"
"  scan: scrub repaired 0B in 00:19:16 with 0 errors on Sat Jul 11 10:32:19 2026\n"
"config:\n"
msgstr "# zpool status storage\n  pool: storage\n state: ONLINE\n  scan: scrub repaired 0B in 00:19:16 with 0 errors on Sat Jul 11 10:32:19 2026\nconfig:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:492
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The completion date of the last scrub operation is displayed to help "
#| "track when another scrub is required. Routine scrubs help protect data "
#| "from silent corruption and ensure the integrity of the pool."
msgid ""
"Displaying the completion date of the last scrubbing helps decide when to "
"start another.  Routine scrubs help protect data from silent corruption and "
"ensure the integrity of the pool."
msgstr ""
"查询结果会显示上次清理时间来协助判断是否还需要清理，定期清理可以确保数据完整"
"性。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:494
#, fuzzy
msgid "Refer to man:zfs[8] and man:zpool[8] for other ZFS options."
msgstr "有关其他 ZFS 选项，请参阅 man:zfs[8] 和 man:zpool[8]。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:496
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`zpool` Administration"
msgstr "`zpool` 管理"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:503
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ZFS administration uses two main utilities.  The `zpool` utility controls "
"the operation of the pool and allows adding, removing, replacing, and "
"managing disks.  The crossref:zfs[zfs-zfs,`zfs`] utility allows creating, "
"destroying, and managing datasets, both crossref:zfs[zfs-term-filesystem,"
"file systems] and crossref:zfs[zfs-term-volume,volumes]."
msgstr "ZFS 管理主要使用两个实用工具。`zpool` 实用工具控制存储池的运行，并可添加、移除、更换和管理磁盘。crossref:zfs[zfs-zfs,`zfs`] 实用工具用于创建、销毁和管理数据集，包括 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-filesystem,文件系统]和 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-volume,卷]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:505
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating and Destroying Storage Pools"
msgstr "创建与删除存储池"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:515
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The most important decision when creating a ZFS storage pool is which types "
"of vdevs to group the physical disks into.  See the list of crossref:zfs[zfs-"
"term-vdev,vdev types] for details about the possible options.  The vdev "
"types determine the redundancy, capacity, and performance characteristics of "
"a pool.  A pool's layout is not fixed forever at creation time.  Mirrors "
"allow adding new disks to the vdev, and stripes upgrade to mirrors by "
"attaching a new disk to the vdev.  RAID-Z vdevs grow one disk at a time with "
"crossref:zfs[zfs-zpool-raidz-expansion,RAID-Z expansion], which requires "
"OpenZFS 2.3 or later, first available in FreeBSD 15.0.  Adding new vdevs "
"expands a pool at any time, and crossref:zfs[zfs-zpool-attach,removing top-"
"level vdevs] is possible within limits.  Reshaping a live pool takes time "
"and I/O bandwidth, so choosing suitable vdev types up front remains "
"important."
msgstr "创建 ZFS 存储池时，最重要的决定是将物理磁盘组合成哪些类型的 vdev。有关可选类型的详情，请参阅 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-vdev,vdev 类型]列表。vdev 类型决定了存储池的冗余性、容量和性能特征。存储池的布局并非创建后就永远固定。镜像 vdev 可以添加新磁盘，条带 vdev 则可通过向 vdev 添加新磁盘升级为镜像。RAID-Z vdev 可通过 crossref:zfs[zfs-zpool-raidz-expansion,RAID-Z 扩展]逐次增加一块磁盘；此功能需要 OpenZFS 2.3 或更高版本，最早随 FreeBSD 15.0 提供。随时添加新的 vdev 可扩展存储池，且在一定限制范围内可以 crossref:zfs[zfs-zpool-attach,移除顶层 vdev]。重塑运行中的存储池需要时间和 I/O 带宽，因此事先选择合适的 vdev 类型仍然很重要。"

