#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:767
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`zpool add` also attaches dedicated log and cache devices to an existing "
"pool.  A crossref:zfs[zfs-term-vdev-log,log] vdev stores the ZFS intent log "
"on separate low-latency storage, accelerating synchronous writes such as "
"those issued by databases and NFS.  Mirror log devices, because losing an "
"unmirrored log device together with a system crash costs the pool the last "
"few seconds of synchronous writes; see crossref:zfs[zfs-advanced-zil-slog,"
"\"Synchronous Writes, the ZIL, and SLOG\"] for sizing and tuning guidance.  "
"A crossref:zfs[zfs-term-vdev-cache,cache] vdev extends the crossref:zfs[zfs-"
"term-arc,ARC] with a second level of read cache on fast storage.  Cache "
"devices need no redundancy, as ZFS reads any block that fails to read from "
"the cache from the original pool disks instead.  The contents of the cache, "
"the crossref:zfs[zfs-term-l2arc,L2ARC], survive reboots by default."
msgstr "`zpool add` 还可向现有存储池添加专用日志设备和缓存设备。crossref:zfs[zfs-term-vdev-log,日志] vdev 会将 ZFS 意图日志存储在独立的低延迟存储上，从而加快数据库和 NFS 等发出的同步写入。日志设备应采用镜像，因为若未镜像的日志设备与系统崩溃同时发生故障，存储池会丢失最后几秒的同步写入；有关容量规划和调优建议，请参阅 crossref:zfs[zfs-advanced-zil-slog,\"同步写入、ZIL 和 SLOG\"]。crossref:zfs[zfs-term-vdev-cache,缓存] vdev 会在快速存储上提供第二级读取缓存，以扩展 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC]。缓存设备无需冗余，因为 ZFS 无法从缓存读取某个块时，会改从原存储池磁盘读取。缓存内容 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-l2arc,L2ARC] 默认会在重启后保留。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:769
