#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:888
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "RAID-Z Expansion"
msgstr "RAID-Z 扩展"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:891
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"RAID-Z expansion grows an existing RAID-Z vdev by one disk at a time, "
"without changing its parity level."
msgstr "RAID-Z 扩展可逐次增加一块磁盘来扩展现有 RAID-Z vdev，而不会改变其校验级别。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:896
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"RAID-Z expansion requires OpenZFS 2.3 or later, first available in FreeBSD "
"15.0.  Pools created on earlier releases need the `raidz_expansion` feature "
"enabled with `zpool upgrade` before expanding."
msgstr "RAID-Z 扩展需要 OpenZFS 2.3 或更高版本，最早随 FreeBSD 15.0 提供。在更早版本中创建的存储池，必须先使用 `zpool upgrade` 启用 `raidz_expansion` 功能，然后才能扩展。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:899
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To expand a RAID-Z vdev, run `zpool attach` with the name of the RAID-Z vdev "
"as shown by `zpool status` and the new disk:"
msgstr "若要扩展 RAID-Z vdev，请运行 `zpool attach`，指定 `zpool status` 显示的 RAID-Z vdev 名称和新磁盘："

#. type: delimited block . 4
