#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3241
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# zfs set userquota@joe=none storage/home/joe\n"
msgstr "# zfs set userquota@joe=none storage/home/joe\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3248
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"User quota properties are not displayed by `zfs get all`.  Non-`root` users "
"can't see other's quotas unless granted the `userquota` privilege.  Users "
"with this privilege are able to view and set everyone's quota."
