#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3251
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The general format for setting a group quota is: `groupquota@_group_=_size_`."
msgstr "设置组配额的通用格式为：`groupquota@_group_=_size_`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3253
#, fuzzy
msgid "To set the quota for the group _firstgroup_ to 50 GB, use:"
