msgstr "与用户配额属性一样，非 `root` 用户可以查看其所属组的配额。拥有 `groupquota` 权限的用户或 `root` 可以查看并设置所有组的所有配额。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3272
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To display the amount of space used by each user on a file system or "
