msgstr "bucket              allocated                       referenced\n______   ______________________________   ______________________________\nrefcnt   blocks   LSIZE   PSIZE   DSIZE   blocks   LSIZE   PSIZE   DSIZE\n------   ------   -----   -----   -----   ------   ------   -----   -----\n     1    2.58M    289G    264G    264G    2.58M    289G    264G    264G\n     2     206K   12.6G   10.4G   10.4G     430K   26.4G   21.6G   21.6G\n     4    37.6K    692M    276M    276M     170K   3.04G   1.26G   1.26G\n     8    2.18K   45.2M   19.4M   19.4M    20.0K    425M    176M    176M\n    16      174   2.83M   1.20M   1.20M    3.33K   48.4M   20.4M   20.4M\n    32       40   2.17M    222K    222K    1.70K   97.2M   9.91M   9.91M\n    64        9     56K   10.5K   10.5K      865   4.96M    948K    948K\n   128        2   9.50K      2K      2K      419   2.11M    438K    438K\n   256        5   61.5K     12K     12K    1.90K   23.0M   4.47M   4.47M\n    1K        2      1K      1K      1K    2.98K   1.49M   1.49M   1.49M\n Total    2.82M    303G    275G    275G    3.20M    319G    287G    287G\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3526
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "dedup = 1.05, compress = 1.11, copies = 1.00, dedup * compress / copies = 1.16\n"
msgstr "dedup = 1.05, compress = 1.11, copies = 1.00, dedup * compress / copies = 1.16\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3533
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After `zdb -S` finishes analyzing the pool, it shows the space reduction "
"ratio that activating deduplication would achieve.  In this case, `1.16` is "
"a poor space saving ratio mainly provided by compression.  Activating "
"deduplication on this pool would not save any amount of space, and is not "
"worth the amount of memory required to enable deduplication.  Using the "
"formula _ratio = dedup * compress / copies_, system administrators can plan "
"the storage allocation, deciding whether the workload will contain enough "
"duplicate blocks to justify the memory requirements.  If the data is "
"reasonably compressible, the space savings may be good."
msgstr "`zdb -S` 完成对存储池的分析后，会显示启用重复数据删除可达到的空间缩减比。本例中的 `1.16` 空间节省效果不佳，主要来自压缩。对此存储池启用重复数据删除不会节省任何空间，也不值得为此付出启用重复数据删除所需的内存。系统管理员可以使用公式 __ratio = dedup * compress / copies__ 规划存储分配，判断工作负载中是否有足够多的重复块，值得满足其内存需求。如果数据具有较好的可压缩性，节省空间的效果可能会不错。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3541
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Fast dedup, a reworked implementation that lowers these costs, requires "
"OpenZFS 2.3 or later, first available in FreeBSD 15.0.  Fast dedup batches "
"deduplication table updates in an on-disk log and flushes them to the table "
"in the background, reducing the random I/O that made classic deduplication "
"slow.  The `dedup_table_quota` pool property sets a limit on the on-disk "
"size of the table; ZFS stops adding new entries once the pool reaches the "
"limit, and with the default value of `auto` the size of a dedicated dedup "
"vdev serves as the quota.  The read-only `dedup_table_size` pool property "
"reports the current size of the table.  `zpool ddtprune -p 30 pool` removes "
"the oldest 30% of the table entries that provide no savings because only a "
"single block references them; `-d _days_` instead prunes single-reference "
"entries older than the given number of days.  `zpool status -DD pool` "
"displays deduplication table statistics, including a histogram of blocks by "
"reference count.  Storing the table on a dedicated crossref:zfs[zfs-zpool-"
"special,dedup vdev] made of fast devices keeps lookups quick even when the "
"table outgrows RAM."
msgstr "快速重复数据删除是一种经过重新设计、可降低这些开销的实现，需要 OpenZFS 2.3 或更高版本；该版本首次随 FreeBSD 15.0 发布。快速重复数据删除会将重复数据删除表的更新批量写入磁盘日志，再在后台刷新到表中，从而减少导致传统重复数据删除速度缓慢的随机 I/O。存储池属性 `dedup_table_quota` 用于设置表在磁盘上的大小上限；存储池达到上限后，ZFS 会停止添加新条目。默认值为 `auto` 时，专用重复数据删除 vdev 的大小用作配额。只读存储池属性 `dedup_table_size` 会报告当前表大小。`zpool ddtprune -p 30 pool` 会删除表中最旧的 30% 条目，这些条目因仅被一个块引用而无法节省空间；`-d _days_` 则会删除早于指定天数且仅被一个块引用的条目。`zpool status -DD pool` 会显示重复数据删除表的统计信息，包括按引用计数统计的块直方图。将表存放在由快速设备组成的专用 crossref:zfs[zfs-zpool-special,dedup vdev] 上，即使表的大小超过 RAM，也能保持快速查找。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3544
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Good practice is to enable compression first as compression also provides "
"greatly increased performance.  Enable deduplication in cases where savings "
"are considerable and with enough available memory for the crossref:zfs[zfs-"
"term-deduplication,DDT]."
msgstr "良好的做法是先启用压缩，因为压缩也能显著提升性能。只有在节省效果可观且有足够内存容纳 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-deduplication,DDT] 时，才启用重复数据删除。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3546
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "ZFS and Jails"
msgstr "ZFS 与 Jail"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3552
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Use `zfs jail` and the corresponding `jailed` property to delegate a ZFS "
"dataset to a crossref:jails[jails,Jail].  `zfs jail _jailid_` attaches a "
"dataset to the specified jail, and `zfs unjail` detaches it.  To control the "
"dataset from within a jail, set the `jailed` property.  ZFS forbids mounting "
"a jailed dataset on the host because it may have mount points that would "
"compromise the security of the host."
msgstr "使用 `zfs jail` 和对应的 `jailed` 属性，可将 ZFS 数据集委派给 crossref:jails[jails,Jail]。`zfs jail _jailid_` 会将数据集附加到指定的 jail，而 `zfs unjail` 会将其分离。要在 jail 内控制该数据集，请设置 `jailed` 属性。ZFS 禁止在主机上挂载已委派给 jail 的数据集，因为其中可能包含会危及主机安全的挂载点。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3556
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A delegated dataset hands control of a whole subtree to the jail "
"administrator, who can mount it, create child datasets, take snapshots, and "
"change properties, all confined to that subtree.  For this to work, the jail "
"needs the `allow.mount` and `allow.mount.zfs` parameters enabled and the "
"`enforce_statfs` parameter set to a value lower than 2.  Refer to man:"
"jail[8] for details on these parameters."
msgstr "委派数据集会将整个子树的控制权交给 jail 管理员；管理员可以挂载该数据集、创建子数据集、创建快照和更改属性，但所有操作都限制在该子树内。要使其正常工作，必须为 jail 启用 `allow.mount` 和 `allow.mount.zfs` 参数，并将 `enforce_statfs` 参数设置为小于 2 的值。有关这些参数的详情，请参见 man:jail[8]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3558
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This example creates a dataset, marks it as jailed, and attaches it to the "
"running jail _myjail_:"
msgstr "此示例创建一个数据集，将其标记为已委派给 jail，并将其附加到正在运行的 jail _myjail_："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3564
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs create mypool/jaildata\n"
"# zfs set jailed=on mypool/jaildata\n"
"# zfs jail myjail mypool/jaildata\n"
msgstr "# zfs create mypool/jaildata\n# zfs set jailed=on mypool/jaildata\n# zfs jail myjail mypool/jaildata\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3569
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The dataset then appears in `zfs list` inside the jail and is manageable "
"there.  `zfs unjail myjail mypool/jaildata` returns control to the host.  "
"See man:zfs-jail[8] for more information."
msgstr "随后，该数据集会显示在 jail 内的 `zfs list` 输出中，并可在那里进行管理。运行 `zfs unjail myjail mypool/jaildata` 可将控制权交还给主机。更多信息请参见 man:zfs-jail[8]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3574
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Starting with FreeBSD 15.0, man:jail[8] automates the attachment.  List the "
"datasets to delegate in the `zfs.dataset` jail parameter, and man:jail[8] "
"attaches them when the jail starts.  The datasets must already have "
"`jailed=on` set, and the parameter requires `allow.mount.zfs`.  An [."
"filename]#/etc/jail.conf# entry using it looks like this:"
msgstr "从 FreeBSD 15.0 开始，man:jail[8] 会自动完成附加操作。在 jail 参数 `zfs.dataset` 中列出要委派的数据集，man:jail[8] 就会在 jail 启动时将它们附加。必须预先为这些数据集设置 `jailed=on`，并且该参数要求启用 `allow.mount.zfs`。使用该参数的 [.filename]#/etc/jail.conf# 配置项如下所示："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3587
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"myjail {\n"
"    path = \"/usr/local/jails/myjail\";\n"
"    host.hostname = \"myjail.example.org\";\n"
"    exec.start = \"/bin/sh /etc/rc\";\n"
"    exec.stop = \"/bin/sh /etc/rc.shutdown\";\n"
"    allow.mount;\n"
"    allow.mount.zfs;\n"
"    enforce_statfs = 1;\n"
"    zfs.dataset = \"mypool/jaildata\";\n"
"}\n"
msgstr "myjail {\n    path = \"/usr/local/jails/myjail\";\n    host.hostname = \"myjail.example.org\";\n    exec.start = \"/bin/sh /etc/rc\";\n    exec.stop = \"/bin/sh /etc/rc.shutdown\";\n    allow.mount;\n    allow.mount.zfs;\n    enforce_statfs = 1;\n    zfs.dataset = \"mypool/jaildata\";\n}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3590
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Setting the `zfs.mount_snapshot` jail parameter to 1 additionally lets users "
"inside the jail access the contents of ZFS snapshots under the [.filename]#."
"zfs# directory of the delegated file systems."
msgstr "将 jail 参数 `zfs.mount_snapshot` 设置为 1，还可以让 jail 内的用户访问委派文件系统中 [.filename]#.zfs# 目录下的 ZFS 快照内容。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3592
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delegated Administration"
msgstr "委托管理"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3600
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A comprehensive permission delegation system allows unprivileged users to "
"perform ZFS administration functions.  For example, if each user's home "
"directory is a dataset, users need permission to create and destroy "
"snapshots of their home directories.  A user performing backups can get "
"permission to use replication features.  ZFS allows a usage statistics "
"script to run with access to only the space usage data for all users.  "
"Delegating the ability to delegate permissions is also possible.  Permission "
"delegation is possible for each subcommand and most properties."
msgstr ""
"一个全面性的权限委托系统可能无权限的使用者执行 <acronym>ZFS</acronym> 的管理"
"功能。例如，若每个使用者的家目录均为一个数据集，便可以给予使用者权限建立与摧"
"毁它们家目录中的快照。可以给予备份使用者使用备份功能的权限。一个使用量统计的 "
"Script 可以允许其在执行时能存取所有使用者的空间利用率资料。甚至可以将委托权限"
"委托给其他人，每个子指令与大多数属性都可使用权限委托。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3602
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delegating Dataset Creation"
msgstr "委托数据集建立"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3608
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`zfs allow _someuser_ create _mydataset_` gives the specified user "
"permission to create child datasets under the selected parent dataset.  A "
"caveat: creating a new dataset involves mounting it.  That requires setting "
"the FreeBSD `vfs.usermount` man:sysctl[8] to `1` to allow non-root users to "
"mount a file system.  Another restriction aimed at preventing abuse: non-"
"`root` users must own the mountpoint where the file system is to be mounted."
msgstr "`zfs allow _someuser_ create _mydataset_` 会授予指定用户在选定的父数据集下创建子数据集的权限。需要注意的是，创建新数据集时会涉及挂载操作。为允许非 root 用户挂载文件系统，必须将 FreeBSD `vfs.usermount` man:sysctl[8] 设置为 `1`。此外，为防止滥用，非 `root` 用户必须拥有文件系统将要挂载到的挂载点。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3610
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delegating Permission Delegation"
msgstr "委托权限委托"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3614
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`zfs allow _someuser_ allow _mydataset_` gives the specified user the "
"ability to assign any permission they have on the target dataset, or its "
"children, to other users.  If a user has the `snapshot` permission and the "
"`allow` permission, that user can then grant the `snapshot` permission to "
"other users."
msgstr "`zfs allow _someuser_ allow _mydataset_` 会允许指定用户将其在目标数据集或其子数据集上拥有的任意权限授予其他用户。如果用户拥有 `snapshot` 和 `allow` 权限，该用户就可以将 `snapshot` 权限授予其他用户。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3616
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "ZFS Native Encryption"
msgstr "ZFS 原生加密"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3622
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ZFS supports native encryption of datasets and the data stored within them.  "
"This was not always the case, as previous solutions relied on FreeBSD's GELI-"
"based encryption.  While this approach is secure, it was not as easily "
"portable to non-FreeBSD systems that lacked GELI support.  With ZFS native "
"encryption, encrypted datasets can be used on other systems that support "
"this pool feature without relying on third-party components or operating "
"system-native encryption."
msgstr "ZFS 支持对数据集及其中存储的数据进行原生加密。过去并非如此，之前的解决方案依赖 FreeBSD 的 GELI 加密。虽然这种方式安全，但在缺乏 GELI 支持的非 FreeBSD 系统上移植并不容易。使用 ZFS 原生加密后，只要其他系统支持该存储池功能，就可以使用加密数据集，无需依赖第三方组件或操作系统原生加密功能。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3625
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Another benefit of ZFS native encryption is that datasets do not need to be "
"decrypted for administrative tasks such as snapshots, replication, or scrub "
"operations.  ZFS data integrity checks work just as well with natively "
"encrypted datasets, and compression also works on encrypted datasets."
msgstr "ZFS 原生加密的另一个优点是，执行快照、复制或 scrub 等管理任务时无需解密数据集。ZFS 数据完整性检查在原生加密的数据集上同样有效，压缩也可用于加密数据集。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3632
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Different datasets on the same pool can use separate keys independently.  "
"Consider a central file server where different users store their data in "
"encrypted home datasets.  User A has a different key than User B.  Both "
"users can work side by side and choose to unencrypt their datasets as needed "
"without knowing each other's decryption keys.  The decryption method can "
"also differ completely between users without affecting one another.  This "
"allows sensitive data from different users to be stored on the same pool "
"while remaining protected by separate keys."
msgstr "同一存储池中的不同数据集可以各自独立使用不同的密钥。设想一台中央文件服务器，不同用户将数据存放在加密的家目录数据集中。用户 A 使用的密钥与用户 B 不同。两位用户可以并行工作，并根据需要选择解密各自的数据集，而无需知道对方的解密密钥。用户之间也可以完全采用不同的解密方式，互不影响。这样，不同用户的敏感数据就能存放在同一存储池中，同时由各自独立的密钥保护。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3634
#, fuzzy
msgid "Before using ZFS native encryption, be aware of the following:"
msgstr "使用 ZFS 原生加密前，请注意以下事项："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3636
#, fuzzy
msgid "Encryption is applied at the dataset level, not the pool level."
msgstr "加密在数据集级别启用，而不是在存储池级别启用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3637
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Booting from encrypted ZFS datasets is not yet supported in FreeBSD's loader."
msgstr "FreeBSD 的 loader 目前尚不支持从加密的 ZFS 数据集启动。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3638
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Encryption can only be enabled when a dataset is created, not afterward."
msgstr "只能在创建数据集时启用加密，之后无法启用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3639
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The block cipher, key length, and encryption mode cannot be changed after "
"they have been set."
msgstr "设置块密码、密钥长度和加密模式后，均无法更改。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3640
#, fuzzy
msgid "ZFS does not encrypt metadata."
msgstr "ZFS 不会加密元数据。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3644
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The last point may seem like a drawback compared to full-disk encryption.  "
"However, it provides greater flexibility by allowing different keys to "
"protect datasets within the same pool instead of requiring a single key or "
"passphrase to unlock the entire pool.  Specifically, ZFS encrypts the "
"following:"
msgstr "与全盘加密相比，最后一点可能看起来是个缺点。不过，它允许使用不同的密钥保护同一存储池中的不同数据集，而不必使用单个密钥或口令解锁整个存储池，因此更加灵活。具体来说，ZFS 会加密以下内容："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3646
#, fuzzy
msgid "file and zvol data,"
msgstr "文件和 zvol 数据，"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3647
#, fuzzy
msgid "file attributes,"
msgstr "文件属性，"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3648
#, fuzzy
msgid "ACLs,"
msgstr "ACL，"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3649
#, fuzzy
msgid "permission bits,"
msgstr "权限位，"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3650
#, fuzzy
msgid "directory listings,"
msgstr "目录列表，"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3651
#, fuzzy
msgid "FUID mappings,"
msgstr "FUID 映射，"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3652
#, fuzzy
msgid "userused/groupused data, and"
msgstr "userused/groupused 数据，以及"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3653
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Deduplication"
msgid "deduplicated data"
msgstr "去重复(Deduplication）"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3655
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some ZFS metadata and information remains unencrypted, including the "
"following:"
msgstr "部分 ZFS 元数据和信息仍未加密，包括："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3657
#, fuzzy
msgid "pool structure and name,"
msgstr "存储池结构和名称，"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3658
#, fuzzy
msgid "dataset and snapshot names,"
msgstr "数据集和快照名称，"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3659
#, fuzzy
msgid "dataset hierarchy,"
msgstr "数据集层次结构，"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3660
#, fuzzy
msgid "properties,"
msgstr "属性，"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3661
#, fuzzy
msgid "file size,"
msgstr "文件大小，"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3662
#, fuzzy
msgid "file holes, and"
msgstr "文件空洞，以及"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3663
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Deduplication"
msgid "deduplication tables"
msgstr "去重复(Deduplication）"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3666
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This unencrypted metadata allows ZFS to perform routine maintenance "
"operations, such as `zpool scrub`, without first decrypting the data.  As a "
"result, ZFS can detect and repair corrupted encrypted data without accessing "
"the unencrypted file contents."
msgstr "这些未加密的元数据使 ZFS 无需先解密数据即可执行 `zpool scrub` 等常规维护操作。因此，ZFS 无需访问未加密的文件内容，也能检测并修复已加密数据中的损坏。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3673
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To encrypt existing unencrypted data, copy it to a dataset with encryption "
"enabled.  This allows data to be migrated to a secure location within the "
"pool, provided the passphrase is supplied to authorize access.  Typically, "
"this is done by loading the encryption key into memory after confirming "
"knowledge of a secret such as a passphrase.  Once the key has been loaded, "
"the dataset contents become accessible for reading and writing.  To re-"
"secure the dataset, unload the key from memory.  ZFS then makes the dataset "
"inaccessible until the key is loaded again."
msgstr "要加密现有的未加密数据，请将其复制到已启用加密的数据集中。只要提供口令以授权访问，就可以将数据迁移到存储池中的安全位置。通常，在确认用户知道口令等秘密后，会将加密密钥加载到内存中。密钥加载后，即可读取和写入数据集内容。要重新保护数据集，请从内存中卸载密钥。之后，ZFS 会使该数据集无法访问，直到再次加载密钥。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3678
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When encryption is enabled, some ZFS operations behave differently.  ZFS "
"applies compression before encryption to preserve compression ratios.  While "
"ZFS normally uses 256-bit checksums, encryption replaces them with a 128-bit "
"checksum and a 128-bit Message Authentication Code (MAC) provided by the "
"encryption suite.  This provides additional protection against malicious "
"data modification."
msgstr "启用加密后，某些 ZFS 操作的行为会有所不同。为保持压缩率，ZFS 会先压缩再加密。ZFS 通常使用 256 位校验和，而加密会将其替换为由加密套件提供的 128 位校验和和 128 位消息认证码（MAC）。这可进一步防止恶意修改数据。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3683
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When deduplication is used together with encryption, ZFS performs "
"deduplication only within the encrypted dataset, its snapshots, and its "
"clones.  This prevents information from leaking between encrypted datasets.  "
"The tradeoff is lower deduplication efficiency because ZFS cannot compare "
"checksums across the entire pool.  Even so, deduplication combined with "
"encryption still reveals which blocks are identical and incurs additional "
"CPU overhead for each block written."
msgstr "同时使用重复数据删除和加密时，ZFS 只会在加密数据集及其快照和克隆范围内执行重复数据删除。这可以防止信息在加密数据集之间泄露。代价是重复数据删除效率较低，因为 ZFS 无法在整个存储池范围内比较校验和。即便如此，重复数据删除与加密结合使用仍会暴露哪些块完全相同，并且每写入一个块都会增加 CPU 开销。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3687
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Other limitations apply when using ZFS encryption.  The `embedded_data` "
"feature cannot be used with encryption.  Datasets with encryption enabled "
"also cannot have the `copies` property set to 3, because the implementation "
"stores encrypted metadata in the location where the third copy would "
"normally reside."
msgstr "使用 ZFS 加密时还存在其他限制。加密数据集不能使用 `embedded_data` 功能。启用了加密的数据集也不能将 `copies` 属性设置为 3，因为实现会在通常存放第三个副本的位置存储加密元数据。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3689
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Creating and Destroying Datasets"
msgid "Creating an Encrypted Dataset"
msgstr "创建和删除数据集"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3694
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ZFS encryption is enabled by setting the `encryption=on` property when "
"creating a dataset.  Setting this property outside of a `zfs create` command "
"does not enable encryption retroactively, as it only takes effect during "
"dataset creation.  In the following example, a passphrase is used when "
"mounting the encrypted dataset after it has been created."
msgstr "创建数据集时通过设置 `encryption=on` 属性来启用 ZFS 加密。在 `zfs create` 命令之外设置此属性不会追溯启用加密，因为它仅在创建数据集时生效。在以下示例中，数据集创建完成后，挂载加密数据集时会使用口令。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3700
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs create -o encryption=on -o keyformat=passphrase -o keylocation=prompt zroot/secretdata\n"
"Enter passphrase:\n"
"Re-enter passphrase:\n"
msgstr "# zfs create -o encryption=on -o keyformat=passphrase -o keylocation=prompt zroot/secretdata\nEnter passphrase:\nRe-enter passphrase:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3704
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the passphrase is shorter than eight characters, ZFS rejects it and does "
"not create the dataset.  After the passphrase has been entered correctly "
"twice, ZFS creates and mounts the dataset in the pool."
msgstr "如果口令短于八个字符，ZFS 会拒绝该口令且不会创建数据集。两次正确输入口令后，ZFS 会在池中创建并挂载数据集。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3708
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Any data stored in the encrypted dataset remains encrypted while it resides "
"there.  Copying data from an encrypted dataset to an unencrypted location "
"decrypts the data during the copy operation.  The newly created dataset can "
"then be mounted at a different location if necessary."
msgstr "存储在加密数据集中的任何数据在其中存放期间都会保持加密状态。将数据从加密数据集复制到未加密的位置时，数据会在复制过程中解密。必要时，可以将新创建的数据集挂载到其他位置。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3715
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs set mountpoint=/secretdata zroot/secretdata\n"
"# echo \"Hello FreeBSD!\" > /secretdata/message\n"
"# cat /secretdata/message\n"
"Hello FreeBSD!\n"
msgstr "# zfs set mountpoint=/secretdata zroot/secretdata\n# echo \"Hello FreeBSD!\" > /secretdata/message\n# cat /secretdata/message\nHello FreeBSD!\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3718
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As expected, the data is currently available for reading and writing by "
"anyone who has access to the dataset."
msgstr "正如预期，任何能够访问该数据集的人目前都可以读取和写入其中的数据。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3720
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Properties of Encrypted Datasets"
msgstr "加密数据集的属性"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3723
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Listing the ZFS native encryption properties for a dataset is done with the "
"following command:"
msgstr "使用以下命令可以列出数据集的 ZFS 原生加密属性："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3731
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs get encryption,keylocation,keyformat zroot/secretdata\n"
"NAME              PROPERTY     VALUE        SOURCE\n"
"zroot/secretdata  encryption   aes-256-gcm  -\n"
"zroot/secretdata  keylocation  prompt       local\n"
"zroot/secretdata  keyformat    passphrase   -\n"
msgstr "# zfs get encryption,keylocation,keyformat zroot/secretdata\nNAME              PROPERTY     VALUE        SOURCE\nzroot/secretdata  encryption   aes-256-gcm  -\nzroot/secretdata  keylocation  prompt       local\nzroot/secretdata  keyformat    passphrase   -\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3737
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `encryption` property shows `aes-256-gcm`, which is currently the "
"default encryption method used by ZFS.  As indicated by the `SOURCE` column, "
"neither this property nor the `keyformat` property can be changed using `zfs "
