msgstr "[[zfs-term-encryptionroot]]encryptionroot"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3746
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The dataset from which the current dataset inherits its encryption key.\n"
"Dataset clones share the encryption key of their originating dataset."
msgstr "当前数据集从中继承加密密钥的数据集。\n数据集克隆共享其源数据集的加密密钥。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3747
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "[[zfs-term-keyformat]]keyformat"
msgstr "[[zfs-term-keyformat]]keyformat"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3748
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The format of the encryption key. Possible values are: `raw`, `hex`, and `passphrase`. Both `raw` and `hex` keys must be 32 bytes long and contain random values."
msgstr "加密密钥的格式。可用值为：`raw`、`hex` 和 `passphrase`。`raw` 和 `hex` 密钥都必须为 32 字节，并包含随机值。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3749
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "[[zfs-term-encryption]]encryption"
msgstr "[[zfs-term-encryption]]encryption"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3762
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The cipher used for encryption, consisting of the block cipher, key length, and encryption mode. Both the `encryption` and `keyformat` properties must be specified when the dataset is created. Possible values for the `encryption` property are:\n"
"\n"
" * `off` (default),\n"
" * `on`,\n"
" * `aes-128-ccm`,\n"
" * `aes-192-ccm`,\n"
" * `aes-256-ccm`,\n"
" * `aes-128-gcm`,\n"
" * `aes-192-gcm`, and\n"
" * `aes-256-gcm` (current standard when `on` is set).\n"
"\n"
