msgstr "用于加密的密码算法，由分组密码、密钥长度和加密模式组成。创建数据集时必须指定 `encryption` 和 `keyformat` 属性。`encryption` 属性的可用值如下：\n\n * `off`（默认值），\n * `on`，\n * `aes-128-ccm`，\n * `aes-192-ccm`，\n * `aes-256-ccm`，\n * `aes-128-gcm`，\n * `aes-192-gcm`，以及\n * `aes-256-gcm`（设置 `on` 时使用的当前标准）。\n\n设置此属性后便无法更改。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3763
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "[[zfs-term-keystatus]]keystatus"
msgstr "[[zfs-term-keystatus]]keystatus"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3765
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Indicates whether an encryption key has been successfully loaded. Possible values are `none`, `available`, and `unavailable`."
msgstr "指示加密密钥是否已成功加载。可用值为 `none`、`available` 和 `unavailable`。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3766
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "[[zfs-term-keylocation]]keylocation"
msgstr "[[zfs-term-keylocation]]keylocation"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3773
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Specifies the location from which to load the encryption key. Possible values are:\n"
"\n"
"* `prompt`,\n"
"* `file://path/to/file`,\n"
"* `http://some.address`, and\n"
"* `https://other.address`"
msgstr "指定加载加密密钥的位置。可用值如下：\n\n* `prompt`，\n* `file://path/to/file`，\n* `http://some.address`，以及\n* `https://other.address`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3774
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "[[zfs-term-pbkdf2iters]]pbkdf2iters"
msgstr "[[zfs-term-pbkdf2iters]]pbkdf2iters"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3775
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The number of iterations used when deriving an encryption key from a passphrase. This forces an attacker to perform a large number of computationally expensive hash operations. As computing power increases, this value should also be increased from its current default of 350000."
msgstr "从口令派生加密密钥时使用的迭代次数。这会迫使攻击者执行大量计算开销高昂的哈希运算。随着计算能力的提升，此值也应从当前默认值 350000 增加。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3778
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Unloading the Encryption Key"
msgstr "卸载加密密钥"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3786
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Protecting the data stored in an encrypted dataset requires two steps: first "
"unmount the dataset, then unload the encryption key from memory.  This "
"distinction is important.  An unmounted dataset is not protected if its "
"encryption key remains loaded in memory.  Always run `zfs unload-key` to "
"protect the data.  To access the dataset again, load the key and provide the "
"passphrase as described in the crossref:zfs[zfs-load-encryption-key,loading "
"the encryption key] section.  ZFS prevents `zfs unload-key` from running "
"while the dataset is still mounted."
msgstr "要保护加密数据集中的数据，需要执行两个步骤：先卸载数据集，再从内存中卸载加密密钥。这个区别很重要。如果加密密钥仍在内存中，卸载的数据集并未受到保护。务必运行 `zfs unload-key` 来保护数据。要再次访问该数据集，请按 crossref:zfs[zfs-load-encryption-key,加载加密密钥]一节所述加载密钥并提供口令。数据集仍处于挂载状态时，ZFS 会阻止运行 `zfs unload-key`。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3791
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs unmount zroot/secretdata\n"
"# zfs unload-key zroot/secretdata\n"
msgstr "# zfs unmount zroot/secretdata\n# zfs unload-key zroot/secretdata\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3794
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Running `zfs unload-key` multiple times results in an error indicating that "
"the key has already been unloaded."
msgstr "多次运行 `zfs unload-key` 会导致错误，提示密钥已卸载。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3796
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Loading the Encryption Key"
msgstr "加载加密密钥"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3800
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Before an encrypted dataset can be used like any other dataset, its "
"encryption key must be loaded and the passphrase provided.  At this point, "
"the `keystatus` property is still set to `unavailable`, and mounting the "
"dataset fails because the key has not yet been loaded:"
msgstr "要像使用其他数据集一样使用加密数据集，必须先加载其加密密钥并提供口令。此时，`keystatus` 属性仍为 `unavailable`，由于密钥尚未加载，挂载数据集会失败："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3808
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs get keystatus zroot/secretdata\n"
"NAME              PROPERTY   VALUE        SOURCE\n"
"zroot/secretdata  keystatus  unavailable  -\n"
"# zfs mount zroot/secretdata\n"
"cannot mount 'zroot/secretdata': encryption key not loaded\n"
msgstr "# zfs get keystatus zroot/secretdata\nNAME              PROPERTY   VALUE        SOURCE\nzroot/secretdata  keystatus  unavailable  -\n# zfs mount zroot/secretdata\ncannot mount 'zroot/secretdata': encryption key not loaded\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3812
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This indicates that the dataset is encrypted and requires an encryption "
"key.  To mount the dataset, run `zfs load-key` and provide the passphrase "
"when prompted:"
msgstr "这表示该数据集已加密，需要加密密钥。要挂载数据集，请运行 `zfs load-key`，并在提示时提供口令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3820
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs load-key zroot/secretdata\n"
"Enter passphrase for 'zroot/secretdata':\n"
"# zfs get keystatus zroot/secretdata\n"
"NAME              PROPERTY   VALUE      SOURCE\n"
"zroot/secretdata  keystatus  available  -\n"
msgstr "# zfs load-key zroot/secretdata\nEnter passphrase for 'zroot/secretdata':\n# zfs get keystatus zroot/secretdata\nNAME              PROPERTY   VALUE      SOURCE\nzroot/secretdata  keystatus  available  -\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3823
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Next, mount the dataset to make it accessible through the filesystem "
"hierarchy:"
msgstr "接下来，挂载数据集，使其能够通过文件系统层次结构访问："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3829
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs mount zroot/secretdata\n"
"# mount|grep secretdata\n"
"zroot/secretdata on /secretdata (zfs, local, noatime, nfsv4acls)\n"
msgstr "# zfs mount zroot/secretdata\n# mount|grep secretdata\nzroot/secretdata on /secretdata (zfs, local, noatime, nfsv4acls)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3833
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To load multiple encryption keys recursively, specify the `-r` option with "
"`zfs load-key`.  If a key has already been loaded, ZFS reports this with an "
"error message."
msgstr "要递归加载多个加密密钥，请在 `zfs load-key` 中指定 `-r` 选项。如果密钥已加载，ZFS 会报告错误信息。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3838
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs load-key zroot/secretdata\n"
"Key load error: Key already loaded for 'zroot/secretdata'.\n"
msgstr "# zfs load-key zroot/secretdata\nKey load error: Key already loaded for 'zroot/secretdata'.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3842
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `keystatus` property also confirms that the key has been loaded by "
"reporting the value `available`.  To verify whether a passphrase is correct "
"without loading the key, use the `-n` option to perform a dry run."
msgstr "`keystatus` 属性也会通过报告值 `available` 来确认密钥已加载。要在不加载密钥的情况下验证口令是否正确，请使用 `-n` 选项进行试运行。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3844
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Changing the Encryption Key"
msgstr "更改加密密钥"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3849
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ZFS also supports changing encryption keys, such as replacing a passphrase.  "
"This operation does not require re-encrypting the dataset.  Run the "
"following command to change the encryption passphrase:"
msgstr "ZFS 还支持更改加密密钥，例如替换口令。此操作不需要重新加密数据集。运行以下命令可更改加密口令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3855
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs change-key zroot/secretdata\n"
"Enter new passphrase for 'zroot/secretdata':\n"
"Re-enter new passphrase for 'zroot/secretdata':\n"
msgstr "# zfs change-key zroot/secretdata\nEnter new passphrase for 'zroot/secretdata':\nRe-enter new passphrase for 'zroot/secretdata':\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3859
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Running `zfs change-key` requires the current key to be loaded.  If it is "
"not, ZFS still prompts for the new key but then displays a warning that the "
"current key has not been loaded."
msgstr "运行 `zfs change-key` 要求当前密钥已加载。如果当前密钥未加载，ZFS 仍会提示输入新密钥，随后显示警告，指出当前密钥尚未加载。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3863
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `zfs change-key` command can also modify the `keylocation`, `keyformat`, "
"and `pbkdf2iters` properties by specifying them with the `-o` option.  "
"Running `zfs change-key` on an encrypted child dataset makes it an "
"encryption root if it is not one already.  To prevent this behavior and "
"continue inheriting the parent's key, specify the `-i` option."
msgstr "使用 `-o` 选项指定属性时，`zfs change-key` 命令也可以修改 `keylocation`、`keyformat` 和 `pbkdf2iters` 属性。对加密子数据集运行 `zfs change-key` 会使其成为加密根（如果它尚不是加密根）。若要避免此行为并继续继承父数据集的密钥，请指定 `-i` 选项。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3868
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Be aware that changing the encryption key of a parent dataset also changes "
"the key for child datasets that inherit it.  Consequently, those child "
"datasets continue to use the parent's encryption key.  If a child dataset "
"should use a different key, either specify a different `keyformat` when "
"creating it or run `zfs change-key` on the child dataset.  Doing so creates "
"a new encryption root for the child and breaks its encryption inheritance "
"from the parent."
msgstr "请注意，更改父数据集的加密密钥也会更改继承该密钥的子数据集所用的密钥。因此，这些子数据集会继续使用父数据集的加密密钥。如果子数据集应使用不同的密钥，可以在创建时为其指定不同的 `keyformat`，或者对该子数据集运行 `zfs change-key`。这样会为子数据集创建新的加密根，并使其不再继承父数据集的加密设置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3873
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ZFS clones of an encrypted dataset always use the encryption key of their "
"origin dataset.  As a result, the `keystatus`, `keyformat`, `keylocation`, "
"and `pbkdf2iters` properties are not inherited like other dataset "
"properties.  Instead, they use the values defined by the encryption root.  "
"To determine the encryption root, use the read-only `encryptionroot` "
"property."
msgstr "加密数据集的 ZFS 克隆始终使用其源数据集的加密密钥。因此，`keystatus`、`keyformat`、`keylocation` 和 `pbkdf2iters` 属性不会像其他数据集属性那样被继承，而是使用加密根中定义的值。要确定加密根，请使用只读属性 `encryptionroot`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3878
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If an attacker compromises an encryption key, changing the passphrase with "
"`zfs change-key` does not necessarily protect existing or newly written "
"data.  New data continues to be encrypted with the same master key as the "
"existing data.  If an attacker obtains both a user key and its corresponding "
"wrapped master key, running `zfs change-key` does not overwrite the previous "
"master key on disk.  As a result, the old master key may remain available "
"for forensic analysis for an indeterminate period."
msgstr "如果攻击者获取了加密密钥，使用 `zfs change-key` 更改口令不一定能保护现有数据或新写入的数据。新数据仍会使用与现有数据相同的主密钥加密。如果攻击者同时获取了用户密钥及其对应的封装主密钥，运行 `zfs change-key` 不会覆盖磁盘上的旧主密钥。因此，旧主密钥可能会在一段不确定的时间内仍可用于取证分析。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3883
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If a master key has been compromised, the preferred solution is to securely "
"erase the underlying storage devices and create a new pool.  Afterwards, "
"restore the data from a backup to the new pool.  Alternatively, create a new "
"encrypted dataset, migrate the data using `zfs send` and `zfs receive`, and "
"then run `zpool trim --secure` to erase the freed space.  If the underlying "
"hardware does not support secure TRIM, use `zpool initialize` instead."
msgstr "如果主密钥已遭泄露，首选解决方案是安全擦除底层存储设备并创建新的池。之后，从备份将数据恢复到新池。或者，创建新的加密数据集，使用 `zfs send` 和 `zfs receive` 迁移数据，然后运行 `zpool trim --secure` 擦除已释放的空间。如果底层硬件不支持安全 TRIM，请改用 `zpool initialize`。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3885
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Renaming a Dataset"
msgid "Sending Encrypted Datasets"
msgstr "重命名数据集"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3889
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ZFS replication is based on sending dataset snapshots, which can also be "
"created from encrypted datasets.  The resulting snapshots remain encrypted."
msgstr "ZFS 复制基于发送数据集快照，也可以从加密数据集创建快照。生成的快照仍保持加密状态。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3893
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# zfs snapshot zroot/secretdata@snap1\n"
msgstr "# zfs snapshot zroot/secretdata@snap1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3897
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In addition to crossref:zfs[zfs-send-ssh,sending encrypted backups over "
"SSH], using the `-w` (raw) option with `zfs send` transfers the encrypted "
"data blocks to the target pool.  A raw send provides several advantages:"
msgstr "除了 crossref:zfs[zfs-send-ssh,通过 SSH 发送加密备份]之外，使用 `zfs send` 的 `-w`（raw）选项可将加密数据块传输到目标池。原始发送有以下优点："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3899
#, fuzzy
msgid "the receiving system never sees plaintext data."
msgstr "接收系统不会看到明文数据。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3900
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"the receiving system does not require the passphrase since no decryption "
"takes place."
msgstr "由于没有进行解密，接收系统不需要口令。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3901
#, fuzzy
msgid "Backups can be sent without first loading the encryption key."
msgstr "无需先加载加密密钥即可发送备份。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3902
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"an untrusted system can receive the encrypted data but cannot decrypt or "
"modify it without the encryption key."
msgstr "不可信系统可以接收加密数据，但没有加密密钥就无法解密或修改数据。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3904
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To send the snapshot created above as a raw stream to the dataset `secret` "
"in the pool `backup`, enter the following command:"
msgstr "要将上面创建的快照作为原始流发送到池 `backup` 中名为 `secret` 的数据集，请输入以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3908
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# zfs send -w zroot/secretdata@snap1 | zfs recv backup/secret\n"
msgstr "# zfs send -w zroot/secretdata@snap1 | zfs recv backup/secret\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3913
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Without the `-w` option, `zfs send` transmits the data in unencrypted form.  "
"The receiving system may then re-encrypt the data using a different key.  "
"However, doing so prevents future incremental raw sends to that destination."
msgstr "如果不使用 `-w` 选项，`zfs send` 会以未加密形式传输数据。接收系统随后可以使用不同的密钥重新加密数据。但是，这样会导致之后无法再向该目标执行增量原始发送。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3915
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Loading Encryption Keys at Boot"
msgstr "在启动时加载加密密钥"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3920
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `zfskeys` man:rc[8] script loads encryption keys at boot for encrypted "
"datasets whose `keylocation` property points to a key file with a `file://` "
"URL.  The script runs after pool import and before mounting the file "
"systems, so datasets handled this way mount automatically during the normal "
"ZFS startup.  The script does not handle datasets with `keylocation=prompt`; "
"load their keys manually with `zfs load-key` after the system has booted."
msgstr "对于 `keylocation` 属性指向 `file://` URL 密钥文件的加密数据集，man:rc[8] 脚本 `zfskeys` 会在启动时加载加密密钥。该脚本在导入池后、挂载文件系统前运行，因此由此脚本处理的数据集会在 ZFS 正常启动过程中自动挂载。该脚本不会处理 `keylocation=prompt` 的数据集；系统启动后，请使用 `zfs load-key` 手动加载其密钥。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3922
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To switch the dataset created earlier from a passphrase to a key file, "
"generate 32 bytes of random data as the new key, restrict access to the key "
"file, and change the encryption key of the dataset:"
msgstr "要将之前创建的数据集从口令切换为密钥文件，请生成 32 字节随机数据作为新密钥，限制对密钥文件的访问，然后更改该数据集的加密密钥："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3928
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# dd if=/dev/random of=/root/secretdata.key bs=32 count=1\n"
"# chmod 600 /root/secretdata.key\n"
"# zfs change-key -o keyformat=raw -o keylocation=file:///root/secretdata.key zroot/secretdata\n"
msgstr "# dd if=/dev/random of=/root/secretdata.key bs=32 count=1\n# chmod 600 /root/secretdata.key\n# zfs change-key -o keyformat=raw -o keylocation=file:///root/secretdata.key zroot/secretdata\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3931
#, fuzzy
msgid "Enable the script in [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf#:"
msgstr "在 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# 中启用该脚本："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3935
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "# sysrc zfskeys_enable=\"YES\"\n"
msgstr "zfs_enable=\"YES\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3939
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By default, the script loads the keys of all encrypted datasets with a "
"`file://` key location.  To restrict key loading to specific datasets, list "
"them in `zfskeys_datasets`, separated by spaces:"
msgstr "默认情况下，该脚本会加载所有密钥位置为 `file://` 的加密数据集的密钥。要将密钥加载限制为特定数据集，请在 `zfskeys_datasets` 中列出这些数据集，并以空格分隔："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3943
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc zfskeys_datasets=\"zroot/secretdata\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc zfskeys_datasets=\"zroot/secretdata\"\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3949
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Anyone able to read the key file can decrypt the dataset.  Keep the key file "
"owned by `root` with mode `600`, and store it on storage that is itself "
"protected, such as an encrypted root file system or removable media that is "
"only connected during boot."
msgstr "任何能够读取密钥文件的人都可以解密该数据集。请确保密钥文件归 `root` 所有且权限为 `600`，并将其存储在本身受到保护的存储介质上，例如加密的根文件系统，或仅在启动期间连接的可移动介质。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3952
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Boot Environments"
msgstr "启动环境"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3957
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A boot environment is a bootable crossref:zfs[zfs-term-clone,clone] of the "
"dataset tree that contains the operating system.  On systems installed with "
"the Root-on-ZFS layout, these datasets live under `zroot/ROOT`, with the "
"running system in `zroot/ROOT/default`.  Creating a boot environment "
"snapshots and clones the root datasets, which completes in seconds and "
"consumes almost no space until the environments start to diverge."
msgstr "启动环境是包含操作系统的数据集树的可启动 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-clone,克隆]。在采用 Root-on-ZFS 布局安装的系统上，这些数据集位于 `zroot/ROOT` 下，运行中的系统位于 `zroot/ROOT/default`。创建启动环境时会对根数据集进行快照并克隆，整个过程只需几秒；在各环境开始出现差异之前，几乎不会占用空间。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3960
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Manage boot environments with man:bectl[8].  Create a new environment before "
"a major change, such as an operating system or large package upgrade:"
msgstr "使用 man:bectl[8] 管理启动环境。在进行重大变更（例如升级操作系统或大量软件包）之前创建一个新环境："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3968
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# bectl create beforeupgrade\n"
"# bectl list\n"
"BE            Active Mountpoint Space Created\n"
"default       NR     /          2.43G 2026-07-11 11:26\n"
"beforeupgrade -      -          328K  2026-07-11 11:31\n"
msgstr "# bectl create beforeupgrade\n# bectl list\nBE            Active Mountpoint Space Created\ndefault       NR     /          2.43G 2026-07-11 11:26\nbeforeupgrade -      -          328K  2026-07-11 11:31\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3971
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the `Active` column, `N` marks the environment in use now, and `R` marks "
"the one that becomes active on reboot."
msgstr "在 `Active` 列中，`N` 表示当前正在使用的环境，`R` 表示将在重启时激活的环境。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3977
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Perform the upgrade with man:freebsd-update[8] or man:pkg[8] as usual.  The "
"upgrade modifies the active environment, while `beforeupgrade` preserves the "
"system as it was.  If the upgraded system fails to boot or misbehaves, "
"reboot and select `beforeupgrade` from the `Boot Environments` menu of the "
"FreeBSD loader.  Selecting an environment in the loader menu affects the "
"current boot only.  To make the rollback permanent, activate the environment:"
msgstr "照常使用 man:freebsd-update[8] 或 man:pkg[8] 执行升级。升级会修改当前活动环境，而 `beforeupgrade` 会保留系统原来的状态。如果升级后的系统无法启动或运行异常，请重启，并在 FreeBSD 引导加载器的 `Boot Environments` 菜单中选择 `beforeupgrade`。在引导加载器菜单中选择环境仅对本次启动生效。要永久回滚，请激活该环境："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3981
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# bectl activate beforeupgrade\n"
msgstr "# bectl activate beforeupgrade\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3984
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Running `bectl activate -t _beName_` instead activates an environment for "
"the next boot only, which is useful when testing changes on a remote system."
msgstr "运行 `bectl activate -t _beName_` 则只会为下次启动激活环境，这在远程系统上测试变更时很有用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3986
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To inspect or repair the contents of an inactive environment without booting "
"it, mount it at a temporary location:"
msgstr "若要在不启动非活动环境的情况下检查或修复其内容，请将其挂载到临时位置："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3992
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# bectl mount beforeupgrade\n"
"/tmp/be_mount.c1Xk\n"
"# bectl umount beforeupgrade\n"
msgstr "# bectl mount beforeupgrade\n/tmp/be_mount.c1Xk\n# bectl umount beforeupgrade\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3995
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Destroy an environment that is no longer needed to reclaim the space it uses:"
msgstr "销毁不再需要的环境，以回收其占用的空间："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:3999
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# bectl destroy beforeupgrade\n"
msgstr "# bectl destroy beforeupgrade\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4004
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Creating a boot environment before every man:freebsd-update[8] upgrade or "
"large man:pkg[8] operation provides an instant way back to a known-good "
"system without restoring from backups."
msgstr "在每次 man:freebsd-update[8] 升级或大型 man:pkg[8] 操作之前创建引导环境，可以立即回到已知正常的系统状态，而无需从备份恢复。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4007
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Boot Environments and Applications"
msgstr "引导环境与应用程序"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4012
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A boot environment contains only the datasets under `zroot/ROOT`.  On the "
"default Root-on-ZFS layout that includes the whole root file system with [."
"filename]#/usr/local# and [.filename]#/var/db#, so installed packages and "
"their metadata roll back together with the operating system.  Datasets "
"outside `zroot/ROOT`, such as `zroot/home`, `zroot/var/log`, and `zroot/var/"
"mail`, are shared: every environment sees the same files, and activating an "
"older environment does not return them to an earlier state."
msgstr "引导环境只包含 `zroot/ROOT` 下的数据集。在默认的 Root-on-ZFS 布局中，这包括整个根文件系统以及 [.filename]#/usr/local# 和 [.filename]#/var/db#，因此已安装的软件包及其元数据会与操作系统一起回滚。`zroot/home`、`zroot/var/log` 和 `zroot/var/mail` 等位于 `zroot/ROOT` 之外的数据集则是共享的：每个环境看到的都是相同文件，激活较旧的环境不会使这些文件恢复到先前状态。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4015
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Plan the dataset layout around this split before relying on boot "
"environments.  Data that must survive a rollback, such as the databases of "
"an application installed from packages, belongs on its own dataset outside "
"`zroot/ROOT`:"
msgstr "在依赖引导环境之前，应根据这一划分规划数据集布局。必须在回滚后保留的数据，例如从软件包安装的应用程序数据库，应放在 `zroot/ROOT` 之外的独立数据集中："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4019
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# zfs create -o mountpoint=/var/db/postgres zroot/pgdata\n"
msgstr "# zfs create -o mountpoint=/var/db/postgres zroot/pgdata\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4023
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With this layout, rolling back to an older environment returns the database "
"server binaries to their previous version while the database contents remain "
"untouched.  The reverse also holds: files written to shared datasets while "
"testing a new environment persist after switching back, so boot environments "
"do not replace crossref:zfs[zfs-zfs-snapshot,snapshots] of those datasets."
msgstr "采用这种布局，回滚到较旧的环境会将数据库服务器二进制文件恢复到先前版本，同时保留数据库内容不变。反过来也一样：在测试新环境期间写入共享数据集的文件，在切换回原环境后仍会保留，因此引导环境不能替代这些数据集的 crossref:zfs[zfs-zfs-snapshot,快照]。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4025
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced Topics"
msgstr "高级主题"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4028
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "优化调整"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4033
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Adjust tunables to make ZFS perform best for different workloads.  FreeBSD "
"exposes the ZFS kernel tunables as man:sysctl[8] variables under `vfs.zfs`; "
"man:zfs[4] documents every tunable and its default value.  Set values that "
"must apply from boot in [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf#; adjust runtime-"
"changeable values with man:sysctl[8] and make them permanent in [.filename]#/"
"etc/sysctl.conf#."
msgstr "调整可调参数，使 ZFS 针对不同工作负载发挥最佳性能。FreeBSD 通过 `vfs.zfs` 下的 man:sysctl[8] 变量提供 ZFS 内核可调参数；man:zfs[4] 记录了每个可调参数及其默认值。需要在启动时生效的值应设置在 [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# 中；可在运行时更改的值则通过 man:sysctl[8] 调整，并写入 [.filename]#/etc/sysctl.conf# 使其永久生效。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4038
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_vfs.zfs.arc.max_` - Upper size of the crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC].  The "
"default of `0` lets ZFS size the ARC automatically based on the amount of "
"installed memory.  Use a lower value if the system runs any other daemons or "
"processes that may require memory; see crossref:zfs[zfs-advanced-arc,ARC "
"Sizing and Monitoring] for guidance.  Adjust this value at runtime with man:"
"sysctl[8] and set it in [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# or [.filename]#/etc/"
"sysctl.conf#."
msgstr "`_vfs.zfs.arc.max_` - crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC] 的上限。默认值 `0` 表示由 ZFS 根据已安装内存量自动确定 ARC 大小。如果系统还运行其他可能需要内存的守护进程或进程，可使用较低的值；相关指导请参见 crossref:zfs[zfs-advanced-arc,ARC 大小调整与监控]。可在运行时通过 man:sysctl[8] 调整此值，并将其设置在 [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# 或 [.filename]#/etc/sysctl.conf# 中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4042
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_vfs.zfs.arc.min_` - Lower size of the crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC].  The "
"default of `0` lets ZFS choose a small minimum automatically.  Increase this "
"value to prevent other applications from pressuring out the entire ARC.  "
"Adjust this value at runtime with man:sysctl[8] and set it in [.filename]#/"
"boot/loader.conf# or [.filename]#/etc/sysctl.conf#."
msgstr "`_vfs.zfs.arc.min_` - crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC] 的下限。默认值 `0` 表示由 ZFS 自动选择较小的最小值。提高此值可防止其他应用程序挤占全部 ARC。可在运行时通过 man:sysctl[8] 调整此值，并将其设置在 [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# 或 [.filename]#/etc/sysctl.conf# 中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4046
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_vfs.zfs.arc.meta_balance_` - Balance between caching metadata and file "
"data in the crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC]; values above `100` increasingly "
"favor metadata, and the default is `500`.  Increase this value if the "
"workload involves operations on a large number of files and directories, or "
"frequent metadata operations, at the cost of less file data fitting in the "
"ARC.  This tunable replaces `vfs.zfs.arc.meta_limit`, which OpenZFS 2.2 "
"removed.  Adjust this value at any time with man:sysctl[8]."
msgstr "`_vfs.zfs.arc.meta_balance_` - crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC] 中用于缓存元数据和文件数据的平衡值；高于 `100` 的值会越来越偏向元数据，默认值为 `500`。如果工作负载涉及大量文件和目录操作，或频繁进行元数据操作，可提高此值，但这样会减少 ARC 可容纳的文件数据。此可调参数取代了 OpenZFS 2.2 中已移除的 `vfs.zfs.arc.meta_limit`。可随时通过 man:sysctl[8] 调整此值。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4050
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_vfs.zfs.vdev.min_auto_ashift_` - Lower `ashift` (sector size) used "
"automatically at pool creation time.  The value is a power of two.  The "
"default value of `9` represents `2^9 = 512`, a sector size of 512 bytes.  To "
"avoid _write amplification_ and get the best performance, set this value to "
"the largest sector size used by a device in the pool."
msgstr "`_vfs.zfs.vdev.min_auto_ashift_` - 创建存储池时自动使用的最低 `ashift`（扇区大小）。该值为 2 的幂。默认值 `9` 表示 `2^9 = 512`，即 512 字节的扇区大小。为避免 __写入放大__ 并获得最佳性能，应将此值设为池中设备所使用的最大扇区大小。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4052
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"See crossref:zfs[zfs-zpool-create,Creating and Destroying Storage Pools] for "
"why pools on 4 KB-sector drives should use an `ashift` of 12."
msgstr "关于使用 4 KB 扇区磁盘的存储池为何应将 `ashift` 设为 12，请参见 crossref:zfs[zfs-zpool-create,创建和销毁存储池]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4058
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_vfs.zfs.prefetch.disable_` - Disable prefetch.  A value of `0` enables and "
"`1` disables it.  The default is `0`.  Prefetch works by reading larger "
"blocks than requested into the crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC] in hopes to "
"soon need the data.  If the workload has a large number of random reads, "
"disabling prefetch may actually improve performance by reducing unnecessary "
"reads.  Adjust this value at any time with man:sysctl[8]."
msgstr "`_vfs.zfs.prefetch.disable_` - 禁用预读。值 `0` 表示启用，`1` 表示禁用。默认值为 `0`。预读会将请求范围之外的较大数据块读入 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC]，以便在近期可能用到这些数据。如果工作负载包含大量随机读取，禁用预读反而可能通过减少不必要的读取来提升性能。可随时通过 man:sysctl[8] 调整此值。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4064
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_vfs.zfs.txg.timeout_` - Upper number of seconds between crossref:zfs[zfs-"
"term-txg,transaction group]s.  The current transaction group writes to the "
"pool and a fresh transaction group starts if this amount of time elapses "
"since the previous transaction group.  A transaction group may trigger "
"earlier if writing enough data.  The default value is 5 seconds.  A larger "
"value may improve read performance by delaying asynchronous writes, but this "
"may cause uneven performance when writing the transaction group.  Adjust "
"this value at any time with man:sysctl[8]."
msgstr "`_vfs.zfs.txg.timeout_` - crossref:zfs[zfs-term-txg,事务组]之间的最长间隔秒数。当前事务组会将数据写入池中；自上一个事务组开始经过此时长后，便会启动新的事务组。如果写入的数据量足够大，事务组也可能提前触发。默认值为 5 秒。较大的值可能通过延迟异步写入来提高读取性能，但写入事务组时可能导致性能不稳定。可随时通过 man:sysctl[8] 调整此值。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4067
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_vfs.zfs.l2arc.write_max_` - Limit the amount of data written to the "
"crossref:zfs[zfs-term-l2arc,L2ARC] per second.  This tunable extends the "
"longevity of SSDs by limiting the amount of data written to the device.  "
"Adjust this value at any time with man:sysctl[8]."
msgstr "`_vfs.zfs.l2arc.write_max_` - 限制每秒写入 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-l2arc,L2ARC] 的数据量。此可调参数通过限制写入设备的数据量来延长 SSD 的使用寿命。可随时通过 man:sysctl[8] 调整此值。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4070
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_vfs.zfs.l2arc.write_boost_` - Adds the value of this tunable to `vfs.zfs."
"l2arc.write_max` and increases the write speed to the SSD until evicting the "
"first block from the crossref:zfs[zfs-term-l2arc,L2ARC].  This \"Turbo "
"Warmup Phase\" reduces the performance loss from an empty L2ARC after a "
"reboot.  Adjust this value at any time with man:sysctl[8]."
msgstr "`_vfs.zfs.l2arc.write_boost_` - 将此可调参数的值加到 `vfs.zfs.l2arc.write_max`，并提高写入 SSD 的速度，直到从 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-l2arc,L2ARC] 中逐出第一个数据块。此“Turbo 预热阶段”可减少重启后 L2ARC 为空所造成的性能损失。可随时通过 man:sysctl[8] 调整此值。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4073
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_vfs.zfs.l2arc.rebuild_enabled_` - Make the contents of the crossref:"
"zfs[zfs-term-l2arc,L2ARC] persist across reboots.  With the default of `1`, "
"ZFS rebuilds the L2ARC from the log blocks stored on the cache device when "
"importing a pool, avoiding the long warm-up period an empty cache would "
"otherwise need.  Set this value to `0` to always start with an empty L2ARC."
msgstr "`_vfs.zfs.l2arc.rebuild_enabled_` - 使 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-l2arc,L2ARC] 的内容在重启后保留。默认值为 `1`；导入存储池时，ZFS 会根据缓存设备上存储的日志块重建 L2ARC，避免空缓存原本需要的漫长预热期。将此值设为 `0`，可始终从空 L2ARC 开始。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4077
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_vfs.zfs.vdev.max_active_` - Upper number of I/O requests active on each "
"device in the pool.  A higher value keeps the device command queues full and "
"may give higher throughput.  A lower value reduces latency.  Adjust this "
"value at any time with man:sysctl[8]."
msgstr "`_vfs.zfs.vdev.max_active_` - 存储池中每台设备上处于活动状态的 I/O 请求数上限。较高的值可使设备命令队列保持满载，从而可能提高吞吐量；较低的值则可降低延迟。可随时通过 man:sysctl[8] 调整此值。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4080
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_vfs.zfs.vdev.*_min_active_` and `_vfs.zfs.vdev.*_max_active_` - Lower and "
"upper number of concurrent I/O requests the scheduler issues to each device "
"for every I/O class: `sync_read`, `sync_write`, `async_read`, `async_write`, "
"`scrub`, and others.  These per-class limits replace the delay-based "
"crossref:zfs[zfs-term-scrub,scrub] and crossref:zfs[zfs-term-resilver,"
"resilver] throttling found in older versions of ZFS.  For example, "
"increasing `vfs.zfs.vdev.scrub_max_active` lets a scrub use a larger share "
"of each device's queue, finishing sooner at the cost of foreground I/O "
"latency."
msgstr "`_vfs.zfs.vdev.*_min_active_` 和 `_vfs.zfs.vdev.*_max_active_` - 调度器为每种 I/O 类向每台设备发出的并发 I/O 请求数下限和上限，包括 `sync_read`、`sync_write`、`async_read`、`async_write`、`scrub` 等。这些按类别设置的限制取代了旧版 ZFS 中基于延迟的 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-scrub,清理]和 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-resilver,重建]限速机制。例如，提高 `vfs.zfs.vdev.scrub_max_active` 可让清理任务使用设备队列中更大比例的容量，从而更快完成，但会增加前台 I/O 延迟。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4083
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`_vfs.zfs.resilver_min_time_ms_` - Lower amount of time, in milliseconds, "
"that a crossref:zfs[zfs-term-resilver,resilver] spends working between "
"transaction group flushes; the default is `3000` (3 seconds).  Increase this "
"value to complete a resilver sooner when a degraded pool is at risk of "
"losing another device, at the cost of slowing down normal pool operation.  "
"Adjust this value at any time with man:sysctl[8]."
msgstr "`_vfs.zfs.resilver_min_time_ms_` - 一次 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-resilver,重建]在事务组刷新之间持续工作的最短时间，以毫秒为单位；默认值为 `3000`（3 秒）。如果降级的存储池有再次丢失设备的风险，提高此值可加快重建完成，但会降低存储池正常运行时的性能。可随时通过 man:sysctl[8] 调整此值。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4085
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "ARC Sizing and Monitoring"
msgstr "ARC 大小调整与监控"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4091
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ZFS keeps recently and frequently used data and metadata in RAM in the "
"crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC].  The ARC grows on demand up to `vfs.zfs.arc."
"max` and shrinks again when other programs need memory, so on a dedicated "
"storage server it is normal for most of the RAM to be in use.  The ARC "
"stores blocks in their compressed on-disk form and decompresses them on "
"access.  This _compressed ARC_ lets the same amount of RAM cache more data, "
"increasing the effective hit rate."
msgstr "ZFS 会将近期和频繁使用的数据及元数据保存在内存中的 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC] 里。ARC 会按需增长，最大可达到 `vfs.zfs.arc.max`，并会在其他程序需要内存时缩小，因此在专用存储服务器上，大部分内存处于使用状态是正常的。ARC 以磁盘上的压缩形式存储数据块，并在访问时解压缩。这种__压缩 ARC__让相同容量的内存可以缓存更多数据，从而提高有效命中率。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4094
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"man:top[1] shows the current ARC size in its memory summary line.  The "
"`kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats` man:sysctl[8] tree exposes detailed statistics, "
"including the current size, the target maximum, and hit and miss counters:"
msgstr "man:top[1] 会在内存摘要行中显示当前 ARC 大小。`kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats` man:sysctl[8] 树提供详细统计信息，包括当前大小、目标上限以及命中和未命中计数："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4102
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% sysctl kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.size kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.c_max kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.hits kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.misses\n"
"kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.size: 8963041280\n"
"kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.c_max: 15843122176\n"
"kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.hits: 954912441\n"
"kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.misses: 21356847\n"
msgstr "% sysctl kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.size kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.c_max kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.hits kstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.misses\nkstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.size: 8963041280\nkstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.c_max: 15843122176\nkstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.hits: 954912441\nkstat.zfs.misc.arcstats.misses: 21356847\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4105
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"package:filesystems/zfs-stats[] summarizes these statistics in a human-"
"readable report."
msgstr "package:filesystems/zfs-stats[] 可用易读的报告汇总这些统计信息。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4109
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The ARC yields memory under pressure, but on systems that share RAM between "
"ZFS and other large consumers such as databases, virtual machines, or jails, "
"the competition can cause uneven performance on both sides.  Capping the ARC "
"leaves a predictable amount of memory for the other workloads.  For example, "
"to limit the ARC to 8 GB, add this line to [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf#:"
msgstr "ARC 会在内存压力下释放内存，但在 ZFS 与数据库、虚拟机或 jail 等其他大型内存使用者共享内存的系统上，资源竞争可能导致双方性能不稳定。限制 ARC 大小可为其他工作负载留出可预测的内存量。例如，要将 ARC 限制为 8 GB，请在 [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# 中添加以下行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4113
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "vfs.zfs.arc.max=\"8G\"\n"
msgstr "vfs.zfs.arc.max=\"8G\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4116
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Changing `vfs.zfs.arc.max` with man:sysctl[8] takes effect immediately, "
"although shrinking a warm ARC frees memory gradually."
msgstr "通过 man:sysctl[8] 更改 `vfs.zfs.arc.max` 会立即生效，但缩小已充分预热的 ARC 时，释放内存的过程会逐渐完成。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4118
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Synchronous Writes, the ZIL, and SLOG"
msgstr "同步写入、ZIL 与 SLOG"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4124
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Every pool has a crossref:zfs[zfs-term-zil,ZIL].  Applications that request "
"synchronous semantics with man:fsync[2] or the `O_SYNC` flag do not get an "
"acknowledgment until ZFS commits the corresponding intent log record to "
"stable storage.  By default the ZIL lives on the pool's regular vdevs, so "
"every synchronous write competes with normal pool I/O.  Asynchronous writes "
"bypass the ZIL and are written with the next crossref:zfs[zfs-term-txg,"
"transaction group]."
msgstr "每个存储池都有一个 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-zil,ZIL]。通过 man:fsync[2] 或 `O_SYNC` 标志请求同步语义的应用程序，只有在 ZFS 将相应的意图日志记录提交到稳定存储后，才会收到确认。默认情况下，ZIL 位于存储池的常规 vdev 上，因此每次同步写入都会与存储池的正常 I/O 竞争。异步写入会绕过 ZIL，并在下一个 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-txg,事务组]中写入。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4126
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A dedicated crossref:zfs[zfs-term-vdev-log,log] vdev, often called a _SLOG_ "
"(separate log), moves the ZIL to a fast device:"
msgstr "专用的 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-vdev-log,日志] vdev（通常称为__SLOG__，即独立日志）可将 ZIL 移至快速设备："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4130
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# zpool add mypool log mirror nda0 nda1\n"
msgstr "# zpool add mypool log mirror nda0 nda1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4134
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A SLOG helps only workloads that generate a lot of synchronous writes, such "
"as NFS servers and databases.  It makes no difference for purely "
"asynchronous workloads."
msgstr "SLOG 仅对会产生大量同步写入的工作负载有帮助，例如 NFS 服务器和数据库。对于纯异步工作负载，它不会带来任何影响。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4138
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A few gigabytes of SLOG capacity is plenty: the ZIL holds at most a few "
"seconds of incoming writes, roughly one transaction group's worth, before "
"ZFS writes the data to its final location in the pool.  Choose SSDs with "
"power-loss protection and low sustained write latency, and mirror the log "
"devices.  ZFS reads the ZIL only after a crash, so losing an unmirrored SLOG "
"together with a system crash loses the writes that were acknowledged but not "
"yet committed to the pool."
msgstr "几 GB 的 SLOG 容量就足够了：在 ZFS 将数据写入存储池中的最终位置之前，ZIL 最多保存几秒钟的传入写入，大约相当于一个事务组的数据量。应选择具有断电保护且持续写入延迟较低的 SSD，并镜像日志设备。ZFS 只会在崩溃后读取 ZIL，因此，如果未镜像的 SLOG 与系统崩溃同时丢失，已确认但尚未提交到存储池的写入也会丢失。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4140
#, fuzzy
msgid "The `sync` dataset property controls synchronous write behavior:"
msgstr "`sync` 数据集属性控制同步写入行为："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4142
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`sync=standard` (the default) commits synchronous writes to the ZIL and "
"asynchronous writes with the next transaction group."
msgstr "`sync=standard`（默认值）会将同步写入提交到 ZIL，并将异步写入与下一个事务组一起提交。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4143
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`sync=always` treats every write as synchronous, trading performance for "
"safety that helps only applications which fail to request synchronous writes "
"when they should."
msgstr "`sync=always` 会将每次写入都视为同步写入，以牺牲性能换取安全性；这只对未能在应请求同步写入时这样做的应用程序有帮助。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4144
#, fuzzy
msgid "`sync=disabled` treats every write as asynchronous."
msgstr "`sync=disabled` 会将每次写入都视为异步写入。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4150
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With `sync=disabled`, ZFS acknowledges synchronous writes before they reach "
"stable storage.  The pool itself stays consistent, but after a crash or "
"power failure, applications and NFS clients silently lose up to a few "
"seconds of data they believed was safely written.  Do not use "
"`sync=disabled` for databases, NFS exports, or any other data that matters."
msgstr "使用 `sync=disabled` 时，ZFS 会在同步写入到达稳定存储之前就予以确认。存储池本身仍保持一致，但发生崩溃或断电后，应用程序和 NFS 客户端会悄然丢失最多几秒钟的数据，而它们原以为这些数据已安全写入。数据库、NFS 导出或任何重要数据都不要使用 `sync=disabled`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4154
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `logbias` property tunes how ZFS uses the log: `logbias=latency` (the "
"default) favors the SLOG to minimize commit latency, while "
"`logbias=throughput` writes synchronous data directly to the main pool, "
"reserving SLOG capacity for latency-sensitive datasets.  See man:zfsprops[7] "
"for details."
msgstr "`logbias` 属性用于调整 ZFS 对日志的使用方式：`logbias=latency`（默认值）优先使用 SLOG，以尽量降低提交延迟；`logbias=throughput` 则将同步数据直接写入主存储池，为对延迟敏感的数据集保留 SLOG 容量。详情请参见 man:zfsprops[7]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4156
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Direct I/O"
msgstr "直接 I/O"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4161
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Direct I/O requires OpenZFS 2.3 or later, first available in FreeBSD 15.0."
msgstr "直接 I/O 需要 OpenZFS 2.3 或更高版本，首次在 FreeBSD 15.0 中提供。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4164
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `direct` dataset property controls how ZFS handles requests made with "
"the `O_DIRECT` flag:"
msgstr "`direct` 数据集属性控制 ZFS 如何处理使用 `O_DIRECT` 标志发出的请求："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4166
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`direct=standard` (the default) honors `O_DIRECT`: properly aligned reads "
"and writes bypass the crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC]."
msgstr "`direct=standard`（默认值）遵从 `O_DIRECT`：正确对齐的读取和写入会绕过 crossref:zfs[zfs-term-arc,ARC]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4167
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`direct=always` treats every properly aligned read or write as a direct "
"request."
msgstr "`direct=always` 会将每个正确对齐的读取或写入都视为直接请求。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4168
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`direct=disabled` silently ignores `O_DIRECT` and handles every request "
"through the ARC."
msgstr "`direct=disabled` 会静默忽略 `O_DIRECT`，并通过 ARC 处理每个请求。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4172
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Direct I/O avoids the memory copies and caching overhead of the ARC.  On "
"pools of very fast NVMe devices this overhead can dominate the cost of the I/"
"O itself, and applications that maintain their own caches, such as "
"databases, waste RAM by caching the same data twice.  For such workloads, "
"direct I/O can increase throughput and reduce memory use."
msgstr "直接 I/O 可避免 ARC 的内存复制和缓存开销。对于由极快 NVMe 设备组成的存储池，这些开销可能超过 I/O 本身的成本；而数据库等维护自身缓存的应用程序，会因重复缓存相同数据而浪费内存。对于这类工作负载，直接 I/O 可提高吞吐量并减少内存占用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4176
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ZFS still verifies checksums for direct reads and writes, so data integrity "
"protection is unchanged.  Direct writes must be aligned to the dataset "
"`recordsize`; ZFS silently redirects the unaligned portion of a request "
"through the ARC.  See man:zfsprops[7] for the full alignment rules and "
"restrictions."
msgstr "ZFS 仍会验证直接读取和写入的校验和，因此数据完整性保护不变。直接写入必须按数据集的 `recordsize` 对齐；未对齐的请求部分会由 ZFS 静默转为通过 ARC 处理。完整的对齐规则和限制请参见 man:zfsprops[7]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4178
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`recordsize` and `volblocksize`"
msgstr "`recordsize` 与 `volblocksize`"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4182
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `recordsize` property sets the largest block ZFS uses to store a file in "
"a dataset, 128 KB by default.  Matching the block size to the workload's I/O "
"pattern avoids reading and writing more data than the application asked for."
msgstr "`recordsize` 属性设置 ZFS 在数据集中存储文件时使用的数据块大小上限，默认值为 128 KB。使数据块大小与工作负载的 I/O 模式相匹配，可避免读取和写入超出应用程序请求的数据。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4186
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For databases that perform small random reads and writes, set `recordsize` "
"to the database page size, typically 8 KB or 16 KB, before creating the "
"database files.  For datasets storing large media files or backup streams "
"that are read and written sequentially, `recordsize=1M` reduces metadata "
"overhead and improves compression.  Volumes use the `volblocksize` property "
"instead, which defaults to 16 KB and cannot change after creating the volume."
msgstr "对于执行小块随机读取和写入的数据库，应在创建数据库文件之前将 `recordsize` 设为数据库页大小，通常为 8 KB 或 16 KB。对于存储大型媒体文件或按顺序读写的备份流的数据集，`recordsize=1M` 可减少元数据开销并改善压缩效果。卷使用 `volblocksize` 属性，其默认值为 16 KB，且在创建卷后无法更改。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/zfs/_index.adoc:4189
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Changing `recordsize` affects newly written files only; existing files keep "
"their original block size.  Not even crossref:zfs[zfs-zfs-rewrite,`zfs "
"rewrite`] applies a new `recordsize` to existing files, as property changes "
"that affect the logical block size have no effect on rewritten blocks; copy "
"the files anew to store them with the new value."
msgstr "更改 `recordsize` 只会影响新写入的文件；现有文件会保留原来的数据块大小。即使是 crossref:zfs[zfs-zfs-rewrite,`zfs rewrite`] 也不会将新的 `recordsize` 应用于现有文件，因为影响逻辑数据块大小的属性变更不会作用于重写的数据块；要使用新值存储文件，请重新复制这些文件。"

